lumos-md (0.4.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Added Tools -> MCP Allowed Folders: agents get only the open files
    in these folders. With no folder they get no file. After the
    update, add your folders there.
  * Added sections to the status bar: the block at the cursor, the
    path of the current tab, line and column, words and the zoom.
  * Added Copy Path to the menu of a right click on a tab.
  * Fixed a draft recovery or a reload of a file with bytes that are
    not valid UTF-8: the editor kept the old text.
  * Fixed a possible crash when a file reloads during a drag.
  * Fixed a click on an image after an edit above it: it used the
    wrong image.
  * Security and privacy fixes. Update recommended.

 -- confund0 <110197472+confund0@users.noreply.github.com>  Wed, 25 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0000

lumos-md (0.4.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Added the Help menu: Features, MCP Server and About open as
    read-only tabs.
  * Added the themes Dark, Dark blue-grey and Dark slate.
  * Added an MCP tool to show a file: an agent can open a file in a
    tab and go to a line in it.
  * Updated View, Paper look: it shows only with a light theme.
  * Fixed a theme change or a zoom after Paper look off: the page
    kept the old colours and font.
  * Fixed Find with a slow regex: the search stops after half a
    second and the find bar shows "Pattern too slow".
  * Removed View, Accept drops.

 -- confund0 <110197472+confund0@users.noreply.github.com>  Tue, 24 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0000

lumos-md (0.3.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Added the file watch: a file that changes on disk loads again as
    one undo step. A tab with unsaved changes asks first and can show
    both texts side by side, to merge them.
  * Added read-only files: a file without write access opens for
    edits, the title shows [Read-Only], and Save opens Save As.
  * Added Edit, Paste from HTML (Ctrl+Alt+V): a copy from a web page
    goes in as Markdown.
  * Added View, Show Preview: the current tab as HTML, right of the
    editor.
  * Added View, Theme: Default, Light grey and Gruvbox. Tabs have
    rounded handles and a close button each.
  * Added a read-only MCP server (Tools, Enable MCP Server; off by
    default): AI agents can read the open files, with unsaved changes.
  * Fixed Save As onto a file that another tab has open: it is now
    refused with a warning.

 -- confund0 <110197472+confund0@users.noreply.github.com>  Sun, 22 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0000

lumos-md (0.2.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Added one window for all starts: files given to a second start
    open as tabs in the running window, and the window comes to the
    front.
  * Added drafts: a few seconds after an edit, the unsaved text goes
    to a draft file. After a crash, the next start offers to recover
    it.
  * Updated the tab list: it is saved after each tab change, so the
    tabs also come back after a crash.
  * Added the primary selection: selected text goes to it, and a
    middle click inserts it.

