lumos-md (0.1.3-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Added tabs. Ctrl+Shift+T opens the last closed tab again, and the
    open tabs come back at the next start.
  * Added pictures below the line of each Markdown image.
  * Added Ctrl+click on links and pictures: it opens the target.
  * Added the reason to the find bar when a search fails, and the
    number of replacements after Replace All.
  * Fixed the table commands at the first character of a table.
  * Fixed the link and picture commands before an indented line.

